# 🛠️ Fix Bug Rules – Node.js + Express + MySQL + Sequelize

## 🎯 Purpose
Standardize debugging and bug fixing process for backend using:
- Node.js
- Express
- MySQL
- Sequelize ORM

---

## 🔍 1. Identify Bug Layer First
Always determine where the bug originates:

- Controller (request/response issues)
- Service (business logic)
- Model (Sequelize query)
- Database (schema/data)
- Middleware (auth/validation)

